    "created_at": "2022-05-09T09:07:38Z",
    "updated_at": "2022-05-09T09:07:38Z",
    "body": "If I understand correctly, libgit2 v1.4.3 will verify repository ownership. Thus, a non-owned repository will not be discovered, and git should never execute any vulnerable commands. I think git itself also solved this with an ownership check.",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
